\p{I have spent SO much time on my computer this week. My eyes are in a perpetual state of bloodshot\sidenote{If somehow someone reading this has good eyedrops or some other remedy PLEASE reach out}. This ultrawide monitor seemed like a good idea until one actually spends ~10hrs a day staring at it.}

