\p{Unfortunately, the accompanying \strong{beautiful} animations found in [[CAGW]] and [[SXP6]] were a less productive but equally tracked usage of my time.}
\p{The tokamax time is a bit of a hint to what I am cooking up. Due to the likely scenario no one is reading this, there will be an accompanying blog I am also working on [[3AIF]]. If {people working on this} #{\cap} {people reading this} #{\neq \emptyset}. Then email me and we can combine forces!}
